=== Reading ===
defensive-cover vs random tells us whether the policy is COMPETENT (beats random handily) or just passively drawish (fails to beat even random). defensive-cover vs itself tells us whether its own draws (including the D2 §7.2 100%-draw result vs greedy-threat/mcts1k) are explained by ritual self-collision on the symmetric opening (a collider signature) or by something else.
